// Things carried: resources by weight, gear by the piece, and the kit a person starts with.
// Loaded once by Content; ContentTests checks every name in here resolves.
//
// resources: every Resource has one row. category is its one category (old ResourceCategories);
//   kcalPerKg and hydrationMlPerKg are what eating a kilo gives (old ConsumptionHandler), 0 if left out;
//   water must state its hydrationMlPerKg, and only food and water give either.
//   Which resources burn, and how, is fire.json's; which build shelters is shelters.json's.
// gear: the authored design, by kind id (old Gear factory methods). An item carries only its kind and
//   wear. maxDurability is stated on every kind; -1 never wears out. insulation is tenths of a clo over the slot's share of the
//   body (old BaseInsulation). A tent's shelter values are shelters.json's.
// slotCoverage: the fraction of body surface each slot covers (old Inventory.SlotCoverage). Sums to 1.
// startingPack, startingClothes: the old starting kit (GameContext.CreateNewGame). Pack kilos are
//   listed piece by piece and summed in order, as the old kit added them up.
